WEBVTT

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:05.500
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.400
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:23.960
If I open this door, I'll find a new world

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:28.380
A world only just beginning

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:34.630
Even if there are tough times ahead

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
I'm sure I'll make it through

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:48.480
Now I'm making my way through this new world

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:54.780
And I've got hopes and dreams

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:57.620
I'm excited, I'm restless

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:01.160
Nobody can stop me

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:01.200
My heart is all fired up
Nobody can stop me

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:06.330
My heart is all fired up

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:10.380
From here I'll leap into the world

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:10.420
Taking to the sky
From here I'll leap into the world

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:13.550
Taking to the sky

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:19.600
Aiming for tomorrow and beyond

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:25.980
I believe that someday I'll grow up

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:31.020
That's why I'll spread my wings wide

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:56.950
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:58.320
<i>And I'm Jasmine.</i>

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:03.420
<i>We're currently travelling to seven perilous places in order to recover the seven stolen gems!</i>

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:07.430
<i>We've already acquired the topaz,
ruby, opal, and the lapis lazuli!</i>

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:10.940
<i>We had to face some monsters, but they weren't anything we couldn't handle!</i>

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:16.940
<i>Hey now, we don't know what kinds of enemies we'll have to face in the future. You both need to be careful.</i>

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:19.540
<i>Geez, you worry too much, Barda!</i>

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:24.250
<i>And right now, we're headed to
Dread Mountain where the fifth gem is located!</i>

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:42.850
It's so hard to breathe...

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:46.500
It's going to be okay. Just
endure it for a little bit longer.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:50.900
Lief and Barda will definitely
find a way to get us out of here.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:08.470
It seems that even though we're inside our dream, our real bodies can still sense that the air is getting thinner...

00:03:08.470 --> 00:03:11.800
We need to find a way to escape
from there as soon as possible...

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:14.950
By the way, Fa-Glin...

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.450
What has become of the intruders?

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:22.690
They're still imprisoned inside
our trap in the tunnels, Master.

00:03:22.690 --> 00:03:23.600
Hurry and clean up the great Gellick's meal!

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:24.900
-Hey, Ri-Nan!

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:26.970
Yes, Elder?

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:29.800
How are things with the prisoners?

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:35.240
The two male captives are currently sleeping. They seem to be extremely weak.

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:37.790
It won't be long before they suffocate.

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:42.690
Just kill them now and use their corpses as sustenance for the grubs!

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:46.000
He's intending on using us
as food for his grubs?!

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:49.710
But I wonder how they
know that we're sleeping...

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:53.500
They must be keeping an eye
on us from somewhere, then.

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:56.590
Barda, let's return.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:06.680
How was it? Did you discover an exit?

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:08.630
No, we didn't.

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:12.980
Then will we really have no
choice but to die in this place...?

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:17.050
Well, there is one thing that we found out.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:20.830
They can see exactly what's going on in here.

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:23.390
So they're keeping watch
from somewhere, then...

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.700
Is there a peephole in the wall?

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:30.200
A traveller once told me something.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:38.300
There's a strange stone that looks like a normal stone from the front, but it's as clear as crystal from behind.

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:41.810
So this place has strange stones like those...?

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:47.710
So the Dread Gnomes are spying on us from behind one of those stones...

00:04:57.530 --> 00:05:02.210
Regardless, the one thing that we know for sure is that they're watching us.

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:20.380
What do you think those guys are doing?

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:25.370
They're probably fighting amongst themselves, over what little air remains in there.

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:27.100
Wait!

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:35.040
Why would you do such a thing?!

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:40.390
So that I can stay alive, of course!

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:41.900
I won't let you!

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:48.460
You got me...!

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:51.530
It's a draw...

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:58.700
Those idiots, they've gone
and done our work for us!

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:03.080
Perfect. Now we don't have to
wait until they suffocate!

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:09.410
Come on, let's carry them to the breeding caves and give them to the grubs.

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:17.830
Oh crap...!

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:21.380
Shit! They faked their deaths!!

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:26.990
There's a switch here!

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:29.440
Hurry up!

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:34.390
Prin!

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:47.290
There they are!

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:49.790
Don't let them get away!

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:52.960
Prin!

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:54.400
Watch out!

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:55.820
Jasmine!

00:06:57.340 --> 00:06:57.920
Shit...!

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:01.240
Lief!

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:10.530
What on earth is this smell...?!

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:19.210
These things are...

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:21.900
They're Gellick's food!

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:26.980
Open the door! You have nowhere else to run!

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:30.340
There's no saving you after being
hit by the great Gellick's poison!

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.430
Stay strong, Jasmine!!

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:42.140
Damn it! What are we going to do now?!

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:43.660
Jasmine...

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:46.650
What are you two doing?!
Hurry up and use that stuff!

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:50.940
You know, that magical nectar which healed me back then! Where is it? Where have you put it?

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:56.350
We don't any more of that. She already used the last drop for your sake!

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:06.320
No way... Then this is all my fault...

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:07.550
Prin...

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:11.100
It's not your fault at all...

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:13.840
Jasmine...

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:19.950
Just... leave me... behind...

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:21.200
W-What...??

00:08:23.610 --> 00:08:26.220
Make sure... you get back safely, Prin...

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:29.990
Jasmine!

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:30.670
Jasmine!!

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:35.600
Jasmine... I don't want it to be like this...

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:39.000
Please don't die, Jasmine...!

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.550
Prin, give me that bottle!

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.390
What are you going to do, Lief?

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:52.660
This may very well do it...!

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:05.550
No one can survive once
they've been hit by our arrows.

00:09:07.530 --> 00:09:08.240
Wait!

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:14.510
You mustn't use the young Kin as food. We won't be able to harvest enough hide from it, otherwise.

00:09:14.510 --> 00:09:20.240
As long as we have that hide, we will be able to walk freely through the Boolong forest like the Kin once again!

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:23.770
So that was why you attacked the
Kin with your poisoned arrows?!

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:25.480
That's just horrible!

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:31.280
You may say what you will. We must be willing to do anything to survive on this mountain, after all.

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:36.210
Jasmine...?!

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:48.500
T-That's impossible! No one should be able to recover from being hit by the great Gellick's poisoned arrows!

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:51.720
What... happened to me...?

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:57.140
You were saved, Jasmine!
You were revived by a miracle!

00:09:57.140 --> 00:09:58.200
A miracle...

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:03.640
That's right! It was a miracle! And we're able to perform miracles at will!

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:10.420
Remember! You Dread Gnomes were
originally the masters of Dread Mountain!

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:15.630
You were a proud, thriving tribe envied by all!

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:18.250
Shut up! Stop talking as if
you know everything!!

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:23.580
We were able to obtain power
thanks to the great Gellick.

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:33.070
One day, the great Gellick appeared on this mountain, saying that he would protect us from the Shadow Lord and the Grey Guards!

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:37.700
That's right! The great Gellick is the reason why we have survived up until now!

00:10:37.910 --> 00:10:43.200
However, Gellick also turned you all into his slaves and worked you Gnomes like animals,

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:45.700
trembling in fear of death all the while!

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:49.400
Don't you all wish to be
freed from that monster?!

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:54.700
We will lend you our strength, and if we all work together, we can definitely defeat him!

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:59.730
A miracle will not occur if you just sit and wait for it. Believe in yourselves and stand up!!

00:11:01.230 --> 00:11:03.400
Is that all you wanted to say?

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:05.400
Kill them!!

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:12.600
Hey... Let's try believing in them...

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:13.920
Gla-Thon?!

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:16.490
They definitely created a miracle.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:20.000
That's ridiculous! Do you really
think we could do that?!

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:23.100
How many of our people do you think he's slaughtered over the years?!

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:35.520
You lot, lead them to the cavern at the summit. He should be still asleep at the moment.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:36.640
Elder...!

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:42.480
However, that is all we can do.
We cannot fight together with you.

00:11:43.150 --> 00:11:46.720
I understand. We won't trouble
you any further than that.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.990
We will go in by ourselves.

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:52.000
Wait just a minute! This isn't funny!

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:55.200
They'll take all of our treasure
if we let them do that!

00:11:55.530 --> 00:11:57.340
We are no thieves!

00:11:57.340 --> 00:12:01.890
He's right. All we want is the emerald
that's embedded on Gellick's forehead.

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:07.300
Then, allow Ri-Nan and myself to accompany you inside.

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:08.800
That should be fine, right?

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:11.640
Everyone else may remain on standby!

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:17.620
If we don't return, just say
that you don't know anything!

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:52.810
But how are you planning to
fight such a scary monster?

00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:56.100
We'll use the blister that we
picked up on the way here.

00:12:56.530 --> 00:13:02.290
If we can get close while it's sleeping and land a fatal hit, just one strike should be enough.

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:04.910
But what if he wakes up before that?

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:07.860
Don't worry. Everything will go perfectly.

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:12.860
Remember, we only have one blister.
We need to be very careful.

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:17.300
It's just over there. That is Gellick's abode.

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:30.150
Prin, wait out here, okay?

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:34.000
But why? I want to fight with you too!

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:40.000
I have a special mission for you as well. Please protect these two, okay?

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:48.780
If anything happens to us, take Filli and Kree with you and do everything you can to escape this mountain.

00:13:48.780 --> 00:13:49.600
But...!

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:54.310
Don't worry. I can say with certainty
that we will survive and return safely.

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:45.600
Great Gellick, please open your eyes!

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.600
There are intruders here!!

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:50.730
What is the meaning of this?!

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:52.140
Over here, Gellick!

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:55.750
We are here to do battle!

00:14:58.030 --> 00:14:59.360
Now, Lief!!

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:09.490
Alright!

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:19.610
I suppose I should congratulate you for going to all of this trouble just to return my poison to me.

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:22.060
What?!

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:28.500
You fools! Did you not know that blisters are filled with the great Gellick's poison?!

00:15:28.850 --> 00:15:29.930
What did you say?!

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:36.760
We harvest Gellick's poison, make them into blisters here, then transport them to the Shadowlands...

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:38.860
That was the agreement we made.

00:15:39.320 --> 00:15:43.700
But to think that your secret
weapon was a blister, of all things...

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:48.720
What was it you were just saying, Fa-Glin?

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:52.230
Could it be that you were
intending on betraying me...?

00:15:52.660 --> 00:16:01.080
Great Gellick! Fa-Glin is a traitor! So please let me
become your loyal servant in his stead from now on!

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:05.530
Please allow me to serve you as the new
leader of the Dread Gnomes from now on!

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:09.780
Imbecile! How dare you give me an order!

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:11.360
Know your place!

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:16.620
P-Please forgive me, great Gellick!!

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:19.720
Die!

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:23.960
Prin?!

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:25.350
Jasmine!

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:27.630
It's dangerous here! Hide, Prin!!

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:34.410
Are you alright?

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:37.490
Why... did you save me...?

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:38.680
Prin!

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:44.600
Don't worry, these guys are safe too!

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:46.950
Prin...!

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:03.020
Barda!

00:17:05.490 --> 00:17:07.360
Lief! Barda!!

00:17:09.390 --> 00:17:13.080
I will allow you to decide how you will die!

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:18.400
Would you like to be crushed to death, or would you prefer to be turned to stone?

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:27.920
You bastards! Do you really think you can harm me with those pathetic weapons?!

00:17:28.010 --> 00:17:32.180
We won't do your bidding anymore,
even if it results in our deaths!

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:36.900
Let's see what you can do, then!!

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:38.490
Watch out!

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:47.460
Damn it, just how are we
supposed to defeat him?!

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:51.270
Neither swords or arrows can hurt him, and not even the blister could do anything...!

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:07.140
The time for playing around is over! Die!

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:08.400
Run, Lief!!

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:24.610
What is this?! What did I just swallow?!

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:26.760
It is the water from the Dreaming Spring.

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:31.600
"Drink, gentle stranger, and
welcome. All of evil will beware!"

00:18:46.690 --> 00:18:48.100
They did it!

00:19:07.930 --> 00:19:10.560
The symbol of honour, the emerald...!

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:18.610
<i>Lief has successfully acquired the fifth gem.</i>

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:22.500
It's the Kin! The Kin are returning!

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:33.070
Stop. They aren't our enemies anymore.

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:35.200
That's right.

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:41.400
Everyone, discard your weapons! This is their homecoming, and we shall welcome them in any way we can!

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:48.280
From this day forth, we will live
together in harmony with the Kin.

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:53.000
That way, the Boolong trees will no longer dominate the mountain at our expense.

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:10.300
Thank you! We will never forget
what you have done for us!

00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:16.430
It's all thanks to you guys that we're able to return home! Plus, this child has also returned to us safely.

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:20.820
Geez, I'm not a child anymore! How rude!

00:20:22.440 --> 00:20:24.100
That's definitely true.

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:30.130
You have grown a lot in the last two or three days, Prin. I suppose we shouldn't be referring to you as a child anymore.

00:20:30.130 --> 00:20:36.420
That's right! Just wait a bit longer and I'll be able to fly with Barda inside my pouch!

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:39.490
No, I think I'll pass on that.

00:20:43.120 --> 00:20:48.830
Thank you all very much. We wouldn't have made it very far if it weren't for Prin and the Dread Gnomes.

00:20:49.130 --> 00:20:53.080
No, we are the ones who
should be thanking you.

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:57.240
Allow me, as the leader of the Dread Gnomes, to express our gratitude to you.

00:20:58.130 --> 00:21:00.980
Please take this as a token of our loyalty to you.

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:09.100
This arrowhead represents our oath to come to your aid whenever you ask for it.

00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:12.000
When that time comes, the
Dread Gnomes will be at your side.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:13.770
Thank you very much.

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:20.080
Regarding the blisters, you needn't worry. Until the Shadow Lord realises that Gellick is dead,

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:24.200
we will continue to make blisters and deliver them to the Shadowlands.

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:31.820
Although, they will instead be made from river water and Boolong tree sap.

00:21:32.190 --> 00:21:37.020
We will save the real poison that remains for the time when the Shadow Lord attacks.

00:21:37.570 --> 00:21:41.600
And I promise you, we will never use our poison arrows for any other reason.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:48.510
Do you really have to leave, Jasmine?
You won't stay here with us?

00:21:48.810 --> 00:21:54.860
Thank you for your offer, but I can't. We still have a lot to do on our quest.

00:21:54.860 --> 00:21:56.030
No matter what?

00:21:56.980 --> 00:21:58.740
I'm really sorry, Prin.

00:21:58.740 --> 00:22:01.710
But, I'm really glad to have met you.

00:22:05.160 --> 00:22:08.610
Don't cry. You're not a child anymore, right?

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:10.590
Jasmine...

00:22:14.840 --> 00:22:20.120
It's okay. We'll definitely meet
again someday, I promise.

00:22:20.820 --> 00:22:27.240
She's right. We will definitely meet again, when peace is restored to the Kingdom of Deltora once more!

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:47.800
How long has it truly been, I wonder?

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:57.680
I've been watching the moon all this time, bathing in its light

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:05.110
As we moved closer, a goddess passed over us

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:14.780
And just like that, my little dream was carried away

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:20.410
I saw you when I looked to the night sky

00:23:20.410 --> 00:23:20.460
Now that I think of it, your name was written there too
I saw you when I looked to the night sky

00:23:20.460 --> 00:23:25.040
Now that I think of it, your name was written there too

00:23:25.750 --> 00:23:29.340
Above me, a shooting star

00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:32.760
fades into the distance

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.390
When the moonlight starts to wane

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:43.060
I stand under the lazy morning's light

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:47.400
And when that same moon rises

00:23:47.400 --> 00:23:56.240
I'll start moving all over again

00:24:04.810 --> 00:24:06.960
The Deltora Encyclopedia

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:07.980
<i>Gellick.
The Deltora Encyclopedia</i>

00:24:09.090 --> 00:24:15.100
<i>A giant toad-like monster that excretes a sticky, poisonous liquid from its body.</i>

00:24:15.880 --> 00:24:19.400
<i>That very poison is the main
ingredient used in blisters.</i>

00:24:20.540 --> 00:24:24.300
The endless pursuit by our enemies
had us lost within a forest!

00:24:24.640 --> 00:24:28.900
In there, we met a strange owl, but I became
